OL,3,GNEWSACity MPs back Nottingham Forest
OL,4,Astadium expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham's MPs have issued a joint
OL,7,Fstatement backing plans for Nottingham
OL,8,FForest to expand the City Ground.
OL,10,FNottingham East MP Nadia Whittome,
OL,11,FNottingham North and Kimberley MP Alex
OL,12,FNorris and Nottingham South MP Lilian
OL,13,FGreenwood said the redevelopment
OL,14,Fprovided a "historic opportunity" to
OL,15,Fboost the local economy.
OL,17,FIn January, the Premier League side
OL,18,Fsubmitted plans to increase the
OL,19,Fcapacity of the City Ground to about
OL,20,F52,500.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
